Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:24.95,Speaker_S02,,0,0,0,,S02: 接上他的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:28.39,Speaker_S05,,0,0,0,,S05: 大哥这他妈是惊喜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:30.34,Speaker_S05,,0,0,0,,S05: 小弟我愿意等你三天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:30.88,Speaker_S01,,0,0,0,,S01: 好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:34.75,Speaker_S05,,0,0,0,,S05: 黄老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:37.77,Speaker_S05,,0,0,0,,S05: 汤师爷是我的挚爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:40.99,Speaker_S05,,0,0,0,,S05: 你可不能夺我所爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:43.74,Speaker_S01,,0,0,0,,S01: 了然
